  "bodyHash": "89cd95f6efd8ba5c",
  "content": "<p>為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faC3cM3Vq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks</a> 提供補充功能，並加入來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fu5Ic2U1u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Wheelie</a> 的更多滑鼠操作功能。</p>\n<h3>調整項目</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>ALT+左鍵點擊</code> 丟棄整格物品 <ul>\n<li>等同於 <code>CTRL+Q</code></li>\n<li>支援滑鼠拖曳操作</li></ul></li>\n<li><code>CTRL+左鍵點擊</code> 快速移動所有相同類型的物品 <ul>\n<li>等同於 <code>SHIFT+雙擊左鍵</code></li>\n<li>支援滑鼠拖曳操作</li>\n<li>可針對特定標籤忽略物品組件數據</li>\n<li><code>CTRL+ALT+左鍵點擊</code> 丟棄所有相同類型的物品</li></ul></li>\n<li>滾輪分頁瀏覽<ul>\n<li>配方書頁面</li>\n<li>配方書標籤頁</li>\n<li>創意模式物品欄標籤頁</li></ul></li>\n<li>透過 <code>右鍵點擊</code> 進行快捷合成與交易<ul>\n<li><code>SHIFT+右鍵點擊</code> 進行大量合成或交易</li>\n<li>可自訂合成的溢出行為</li></ul></li>\n<li>透過 <code>Q</code> 鍵（丟棄）進行快捷合成</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>依賴項</h3>\n<p>Fabric: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faC3cM3Vq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MouseTweaks</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fP7dR8mSH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></p>\n<p>NeoForge: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faC3cM3Vq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MouseTweaks</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></p>\n<h3>致謝</h3>\n<p>MoreMouseTweaks 使用了 <a href=\"https://github.com/Siphalor/mouse-wheelie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Wheelie</a>（作者：<a href=\"https://github.com/Siphalor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Siphalor</a>）的程式碼，並遵循其授權條款使用。</p>\n<h3>相關模組</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fS8drsznD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClientSort</a> - 物品欄排序快捷鍵。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ft5wuYk45\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tweakeroo</a> - 手動補貨、自動切換工具、防止工具損壞（以及更多功能）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>聯繫方式</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terminalmc.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&label=Discord Server&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord Server\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/MoreMouseTweaks/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/MoreMouseTweaks?logo=github&label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub Issues\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/MoreMouseTweaks/blob/HEAD/LICENSE.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/TerminalMC/MoreMouseTweaks?label=License&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>",
